    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16721\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16721\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator gives the values of the powers of 2 as:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_2_1_integers_7_10/f-10-7-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the formula for the powers of –2 in L3.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16722\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16722\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16723\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qup.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16723\u0026quot;,246)\"\u003e to highlight L3. Enter the formula for the powers of –2 by pressing \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16724\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qopenparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16724\u0026quot;,196)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16725\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qnegative.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16725\u0026quot;,189)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16726\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16727\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcloseparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16727\u0026quot;,121)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16728\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcap.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16728\u0026quot;,113)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16729\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16730\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qstat.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16730\u0026quot;,221)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16731\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e(Note that we need those parentheses.)\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_2_1_integers_7_10/f-10-7-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
